{"unit_id":"tag:0GJ6:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为层（sheaf），定义于<MATH_0003>上。设<MATH_0004>为几何点（geometric point），位于<MATH_0005>上，并设<MATH_0006>为几何点（geometric point），位于<MATH_0007>上。记<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>，其中<MATH_0010>是典范态射（canonical morphism）。对任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0011>，定义于<MATH_0012>上，特化（specialization）映射（map）<MATH_0013>等于特化（specialization）映射（map）<MATH_0014>，通过等同（identifications）<MATH_0015>和<MATH_0016>，见引理<REF_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"canonical morphism","target_term":"典范态射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"identifications","target_term":"等同"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"canonical morphism","target_term":"典范态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化","context":"点的特化。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"identifications","target_term":"等同","context":"层茎之间的等同。"}],"notes":[]}
