{"unit_id":"tag:0GJ7:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），使得每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open），位于<MATH_0002>中，都有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components）（例如，若<MATH_0003>具有Noether拓扑空间（Noetherian topological space）作为底层空间，或若<MATH_0004>局部Noether（locally Noetherian））。设<MATH_0005>为集合（sets）层（sheaf），定义于<MATH_0006>上。以下条件等价（equivalent）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007>为有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 所有茎（stalks），对应于<MATH_0008>，都是有限集（finite sets），且所有特化（specialization）映射（maps）<MATH_0009>均为双射（bijective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact open","target_term":"拟紧开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支"},{"source_term":"Noetherian topological space","target_term":"Noether拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"finite sets","target_term":"有限集"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact open","target_term":"拟紧开集","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian topological space","target_term":"Noether拓扑空间","context":"底层拓扑空间的性质。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"s